Home — native webOS launcher

The window/Skia integration (src/gl.rs), dynamic library loader
(src/platform/dl.rs), glibc compatibility shim, compiler wrapper scripts,
and portions of the Luna adapter and target configuration are derived from
punktfunk/client-webos, commit 678ef23436f0ec534dfdceea45b12031f20dd595.
https://github.com/punktfunk/client-webos

Punktfunk is available under MIT OR Apache-2.0. Both license texts are retained
in vendor/punktfunk. This distribution uses its MIT option.

Application artwork and the Inter font are bundled from catalog/ at build time.
Asset sources are recorded in docs/ASSETS.json in the source distribution.
The Home icon is distributed under the MIT license in LICENSE.
Publisher artwork overrides are documented in artwork/SOURCES.json (included
as artwork-sources.json in packages). Artwork belongs to its respective publishers.
Inter is distributed under the SIL Open Font License; assets/Inter-OFL.txt
is included in generated packages.

The native SDL binary is built from webosbrew/SDL-webOS (zlib license),
commit f599b850f9b1347cebdbb9a806999ddd170ab661, with Home's local cursor
ownership patch (patches/sdl-compositor-cursor.patch in the source distribution).
https://github.com/webosbrew/SDL-webOS
